# Paths held by the fork while upstream PR #673 is unmerged (see fork PR #7).
#
# Our master carries an adopted implementation of nix-community/lanzaboote#673
# in these paths; upstream master does not have #673, so weekly sync rebases
# conflict here. When the weekly upstream sync hits conflicts CONFINED to
# these paths (directory prefixes allowed), it resolves them by keeping the
# fork side for exactly these paths and taking upstream everywhere else. The
# resolution commit lists any upstream commits shadowed by this, so nothing
# is dropped silently. Conflicts anywhere else still produce a manual
# conflict PR.
#
# Remove this file once #673 (ideally with our complementary patches) is
# merged upstream, so syncs revert to plain rebases.
nix/modules/lanzaboote.nix
nix/tests/
rust/tool/shared/
rust/tool/systemd/
docs/how-to-guides/enable-measured-boot.md
